	(text "GPIO map (RP2350A, microfrank / murmulator order):\nSD (SPI) 4 DAT0, 5 DAT3/CS, 6 CLK, 7 CMD | PSRAM CS 8 | HDMI (HSTX) 12-19 | PIO-USB 20 D+, 21 D- | LED 25\nFree: 0-3, 9-11, 22-24, 26-29 (no-connect on the MCU sheet).\nNet names: <M><gpio>_<block>_<signal>. Block codes: SD micro SD, HV HDMI, PU PIO-USB, PR PSRAM, LD LED, UC native USB-C, PW power."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
